            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[1]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "以下文章的著作权等各种权利归原作者所有，翻译 By SeventhTG（XD）。如果你喜欢本文并有幸让你产生了转载的想法，请注明原作者、原文地址以及译者，谢谢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0003"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[2]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "原文地址：http://beginners.biz/reach/reach06.html ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 立直理论2：  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ かけるは内、のばすは外（立直舍内，发展舍外）（太专业了= =，没想好怎么翻） ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  比如124索这样的形， 摸到5索，从两面的角度考虑切掉1索是理所当然的打法。 但是，要立直的话就不一样了。 "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0004"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[3]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b4",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0004"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[3]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例1，手牌右侧依次为摸入牌和宝牌。",
            "imageSha256": "bb16632d9f0dd565352345085759d51eedf624c51a46dd8c08861b0ca7df0c36",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "e3367f0fbd1220491e574e5c011bab37a8205b22b32190a6fcbc4e38b901dc12"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "例1　1m 2m 2m 2m 3m 1s 2s 4s 6s 8s 3z 3z 3z　摸入 7s　宝牌 6s"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b5",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0005"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[4]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这样的牌大致可以立直了。 要立直的话，打4索才是合理的。  要是场上已经有现物的4索，3索也会更加容易被打出一点。 但是这也不是非常有效果的。 4索要是非常危险的话，切1索立直也是可以的。 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 暗刻优先 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b6",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0006"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b6",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0006"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例2，手牌右侧依次为摸入牌和宝牌。",
            "imageSha256": "af06892e72328a29f35eb95fec9965f6995cc4d122ee06768354fba053d794cf",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "2fdf1786a308dde24c7a8352ac5c6133eea45579ff81dc58000d8eb93482c2ec"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "例2　6m 6m 6m 1p 1p 1p 2p 2p 3p 5s 5s 6s 7s　摸入 4s　宝牌 3s"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b7",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0007"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[6]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这样的牌切2饼和3饼都可以立直。 像这样没有平和的牌应该保留暗刻立直。 摸到1饼可以暗杠，不仅可以增加符数，还有可能增加宝牌。 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 情报要少 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 以前流行的迷彩战术（给捨牌中设下陷阱）受到了压倒性的否定。反而是捨牌越没有特征越好。 "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b8",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0008"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[7]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b8",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0008"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[7]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例3，手牌右侧依次为摸入牌和宝牌。",
            "imageSha256": "d56b078cd2ac6631d929c73fa5a68c1d6628e612f56c25d913ca56f3c48f3845",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "444a3e2d0184d4df3e173cc69a9c27040475b8ddbfd671b8f14fdf7db7402028"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "例3　5m 6m 4p 6p 7p 8p 2s 3s 7s 8s 9s 4z 4z　摸入 4p　宝牌 9s"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b9",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0009"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[8]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例3是典型的立直手牌，应该用4饼替换雀头，切北。 这里要是切掉4饼的话，立直之后。 他家会很容易切出"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b10",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0010"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[9]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b10",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0010"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[9]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "从左至右排列的五张筒子牌。",
            "imageSha256": "356b879620ba833ad49a8b9532f9966ee1eff4cb2c172e7637b9d3958772672d",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "9a2ba127e1852a01cce531938cacbd4a7a9e30609ef24f75bac5c8a1d11b0583"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "1p 2p 3p 4p 7p"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b11",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0011"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[10]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "切掉北的话，他家也只能知道你不是单骑听牌而已。 捨牌是幺九牌这种没有什么特征的牌可以说理想的捨牌。 比如： "
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b12",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0012"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[11]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
