            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b13-182-before-note",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这样的立直话，对手只能对日"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited182-1",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "非原文审校注：源文‘这样的立直话，对手只能对日’语义不明，现照录；不能据此确定对手只能采取何种行动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited182-2",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）2】不得补写、翻译性改写或讲解“对日”为任何确定战术行为，也不得把“只能”扩展成已确认的对手行动限制。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited182-3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）3】后文“强大的河”更容易荣和须作为作者明确提出的主张展示，不得声称歧义句已经证明其机制、概率或最优性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited182-4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）4】本次有限允许不认证精确牌谱、隐藏手牌、所有对手的安全度、概率或最优打法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1760573-b13-182-after-note",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1760573",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1760573:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": " 相比不靠谱的迷彩战术，有着“强大的河”更加容易荣和。    （待续）"
        }
      ]
    }
